246 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 139 0 R
/E (If you have a healthy body therefore you will have a healthy mind, your whole body and soul is deeply connected, a quick run or 15 minute exercise may help you clear your head in the morning and give you drive for the rest of the day at competition. Having energy in competition is essential for better performance and this is achieved in the following ways.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
