249 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 703 0 R
/E (Eating well gives you steady energy and keeps you alert throughout the day. Balanced meals that include complex carbohydrates, protein, fruits, and healthy fats help fuel your body without making you feel heavy or tired. Avoiding overly greasy or sugary foods is key to staying focused and feeling good. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
