262 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 707 0 R
/E (During competition it is possible that you or one of the other members of the drive team will become frustrated. Remove yourself from the public eye and find a place to relax, take a moment alone to relax and reset, but make sure to return with a refreshed mindset, ready to compete at your best.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
263 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 708 0 R
/E (Staying hydrated keeps your body and mind functioning at their best. Dehydration can cause headaches, fatigue, dizziness, and slower reaction times, all things you want to avoid during an intense competition day. Drinking water regularly is essential, and electrolyte drinks like sports beverages \(in moderation\) can also help, especially in hot environments. Avoid too many sugary or caffeinated drinks, as they can dehydrate you more.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
