/E (Understanding the performance limits of your robot is essential if you want to push it to its full potential. You need to know exactly what your robot can and cannot do, as well as its failure points. This knowledge not only helps you get the most out of your machine, but also allows you to quickly recognize when something goes wrong during a match. The better you understand how your robot behaves, the faster you can react when issues arise.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
